    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You can cast @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplPlanarBind]{Planar Binding} without expending a spell slot. When you do, you summon a Felguard, a Felhound, an Incubus, or a Succubus, and that Fiend becomes the target of the spell. Once you cast the spell this way, you can't do so again until you finish a Long Rest.</p><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-GfWzCcoUgL9ARXuL\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p>Felguard and Felhound are in D&D: World of Warcraft; Incubus and Succubus are in dnd5e.</p></section>",
